        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>如何挑选性格好的猫咪</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 18px 20px 24px;\n    width: 540px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"Heiti SC\", sans-serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  h1.title {\n    font-size: 33px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n  }\n  h1.title .hl { color: #ff2d2d; }\n\n  .top {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n  }\n  ul.checks {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 6px 0 0 12px;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  ul.checks li {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin-bottom: 13px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .cbox {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 17px;\n    height: 17px;\n    border: 2px solid #f0a35e;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    margin-right: 9px;\n    position: relative;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n  }\n  .cbox::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 3px;\n    top: 1px;\n    width: 6px;\n    height: 10px;\n    border-right: 2.5px solid #f0a35e;\n    border-bottom: 2.5px solid #f0a35e;\n    transform: rotate(40deg);\n  }\n\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #bbb;\n    background: #fbfbfb;\n    color: #888;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n  }\n  .cat-illustration {\n    width: 140px;\n    height: 105px;\n    margin: 8px 0 0 0;\n  }\n\n  .section-label {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-size: 21px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    padding: 5px 10px 4px;\n    border: 3px solid #1a1a1a;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    margin: 12px 0 18px 0;\n  }\n\n  .grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    column-gap: 10px;\n    row-gap: 22px;\n  }\n  .breed { text-align: left; }\n  .breed .photo {\n    width: 118px;\n    height: 118px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #f6ece2;\n    margin: 0 auto 10px;\n    font-size: 10px;\n  }\n  .breed h3 {\n    font-size: 21px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    margin: 0 0 8px 0;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .breed p {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    margin: 0;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <h1 class=\"title\">如何挑选<span class=\"hl\">性格好</span>的猫咪</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"top\">\n    <ul class=\"checks\">\n      <li><span class=\"cbox\"></span>伸手摸它，看会不会主动过来蹭</li>\n      <li><span class=\"cbox\"></span>抱一下猫咪，看会不会抗拒</li>\n      <li><span class=\"cbox\"></span>喂食物，会不会主动积极吃</li>\n      <li><span class=\"cbox\"></span>对猫咪喵喵叫，看会不会积极回应</li>\n    </ul>\n    <figure class=\"placeholder cat-illustration\">[Illustration: cartoon cat, top-right]</figure>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-label\">猫咪品种看性格</div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n    <div class=\"breed\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder photo\">[Photo: 布偶猫]</div>\n      <h3>布偶</h3>\n      <p>性格温和，外表美丽<br>肠胃不太好</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"breed\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder photo\">[Photo: 英短猫]</div>\n      <h3>英短</h3>\n      <p>体型圆胖、毛短而密<br>温柔平静、对人友善</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"breed\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder photo\">[Photo: 美短猫]</div>\n      <h3>美短</h3>\n      <p>性格活泼好动<br>适应能力也比较强</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"breed\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder photo\">[Photo: 狸花猫]</div>\n      <h3>狸花</h3>\n      <p>身体素质好，聪明<br>好养活，寿命长</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"breed\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder photo\">[Photo: 暹罗猫]</div>\n      <h3>暹罗</h3>\n      <p>活泼好动，智商高<br>胆子比较大</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"breed\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder 